  {
   "text": "Stop using AI like a basic chatbot.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.76
  },
  {
   "text": "Right now, an autonomous AI agent can open a browser, search live data,",
   "start": 2.969,
   "end": 7.397
  },
  {
   "text": "and write Python code all by itself.",
   "start": 7.481,
   "end": 9.542
  },
  {
   "text": "Watch how it works.",
   "start": 9.794,
   "end": 10.911
  },
  {
   "text": "First, the agent connects to OpenAI and scans thousands of files in a terminal.",
   "start": 11.126,
   "end": 15.803
  },
  {
   "text": "Next, it builds a complete automation workflow, sends an instant alert,",
   "start": 16.027,
   "end": 20.024
  },
  {
   "text": "and boosts your productivity by 10x.",
   "start": 20.148,
   "end": 22.335
  },
  {
   "text": "The future is not just chatting with AI\u2014",
   "start": 22.534,
   "end": 24.599
  },
  {
   "text": "it is letting AI do the work for you.",
   "start": 24.724,
